OL,3,AUK inflation hits highest rate in a
OL,4,Ayear, driven by rising fuel prices
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the shadow chancellor says the
OL,7,Fgovernment's decision to "hike taxes
OL,8,Fand employment costs" have contributed
OL,9,Fto the inflation increase
OL,11,FMore inflation increases are expected -
OL,12,Fand one consultancy says it's expecting
OL,13,Fa 26% percent rise in domestic energy
OL,14,Fprices in January
OL,16,FEarlier this month, the Bank raised
OL,17,Finterest rates to 4% in an effort to
OL,18,Fcurb inflation - this morning, it says
OL,19,Fit will "continue to set interest rates
OL,20,Fto make sure inflation returns to the
OL,21,F2% target and stays there"
